WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.792
Run your own platform.

00:00:02.233 --> 00:00:06.227
Open Meet Day. Set your two openers, then start the room.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:11.032
Count the attempts before yours. Tap minus as each one happens.

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:17.179
The warm-up card tells you when to take each set. It warns you when the count is shrinking.

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:21.673
Lifting Lab is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
